taurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"JlHO0nd0yXCQbiIIvJm2jQ","review_id":"5CprZYyBllToOQ3OVU1aBQ","date":"2019-08-21T17:10:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.922964870929718,"text_excerpt":"I had so much fun at this bar/club! You first walk in and there's a dj playing hip hop right next to the bar. We got a drink downstairs, they have a couple drinks specials, I got the lemonade for 6 bucks it was tasty! The bartender Bridget was awesome!! They have a club upstairs which was lit on weekends and had good music up there as well. We spent 3 nights out of our trip here because it was so much fun!! Can't wait to come back to NOLA and party here again."},{"business_id":"JlHO0nd0yXCQbiIIvJm2jQ","review_id":"d1Au73aTr3FZtM02NTsVsw","date":"2011-01-10T03:45:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9117975234985352,"text_excerpt":"Bourbon heat is not unlike any of the other numerous bars on the street, except in the downstairs bar they have frozen drinks as well as full bar and in the upstairs bar they feature a DJ. They play techno/electronica which is the only straight club in the FQ that does. The bars are done with a very modern/clean/well lit style. The patio out back is very large with another bar off to the side. Its a decent location and the facility is well done. The crowd tended to be on the younger side due to the DJ. Not my style of club, but has the potential to fare well. This is an independently owned club unlike most others on the street which are corporate owned/operated. The managers are cool, I'v..."},{"business_id":"JlHO0nd0yXCQbiIIvJm2jQ","review_id":"9sbZDu3-ElRjDifl2puecg","date":"2011-02-10T21:08:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9097861051559448,"text_excerpt":"Bourbon Heat has been open for... about 40 days or so at this point, and apparently this particular space hasn't been open since before the storm. I happen to have a friend who is a bar back here, and he invited me to come check out the space. As you can imagine, I didn't have particularly high expectations (it's on Bourbon Street!) but I was surprised to find that it's actually not your typical Bourbon Street bar. The downstairs bar is pretty similar to most places you'll find on Bourbon Street, and upstairs is gorgeous. Overall the entire space is clean, classy (if you can block out the awful music), and not at all what I was expecting. The owner is a local (evidently most owners of clu..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"JlHO0nd0yXCQbiIIvJm2jQ","photo_id":"YvBtSumQ5ajB5TdXfYQDFw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/YvBtSumQ5ajB5TdXfYQDFw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9070178866386414},{"business_id":"JlHO0nd0yXCQbiIIvJm2jQ","photo_id":"_fErRWVLA9Usbsm-8nCngQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/_fErRWVLA9Usbsm-8nCngQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8526508212089539},{"business_id":"JlHO0nd0yXCQbiIIvJm2jQ","photo_id":"_uGWMjT0IFHZOkJWfibQKQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/_uGWMjT0IFHZOkJWfibQKQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8372265696525574},{"business_id":"JlHO0nd0yXCQbiIIvJm2jQ","photo_id":"PEmnIk-UHAfsa7RB0hSWKw","labe